      "content": "idk i'm just worried cuz the calf pain is actually pretty sharp and it feels kind of tight. and the breathing thing isn't going away even after i sat down for a bit. u sure i don't need to see a doctor or something? i really dont want to go to the er if i can just sleep it off",
